024,"A gift in your Will helps the dogs | and cats who deserve it most | For over 160 years, Battersea has been here for | every dog and cat, taking them in without question | and caring for them without judgement until we find | them the homes where they truly belong. One in three | of these animals is cared for thanks to gifts in Wills. | By remembering Battersea in your Will, you help | ensure that we can continue to be here for every dog | and cat who needs us. Gifts in Wills are vital to all | areas of our work, so any gift you give, whatever size, | will make a big difference to the animals in our care. | A gift in your Will costs you nothing today but will help | ensure that Battersea can continue to support the | animals who need us tomorrow. | Together, we will be here for every dog and cat. | éu' BATTERSEA",Newspaper,NA,NA
