033,"ze Z| | Freepost Plus RTKS-ZCXS-HSBT | Wood Green The Animals Charity | 126 Fairlie Road | Slough | SL1 4PY | Can you spare 20p a day to help homeless Can you spare 20p a day to help homeless | pets get a second chance at life? pets get a second chance at life? | she could hardly bear | to be touched. | Sky was found abandoned in a terrible state on a | cold night. When she arrived at Wood Green, she was | extremely thin and could barely stand. Her quivering | body was covered in clumps of matted fur and | faeces, her exposed skin was red and raw. It was | one of the worst cases of neglect we'd ever seen. | It was clear that this adorable lurcher cross puppy | needed us to act fast. But when our vet tried to examine her, | she flinched in pain - and could hardly bear to be touched. | Sky was in a truly dreadful condition. But over time, thanks to our | amazing supporters, we were able to nurse her back to health. | At first, Sky was too weak to be given an anaesthetic, so over the coming | days our nurses removed the matted fur, tenderly bathed her inflamed | skin and applied healing creams. Because she was so fragile, we also | gave her a special coat to wear for extra protection during her recovery. | Help us be there | Five kittens were only hours old when | found dumped at a waste treatment | centre in a cardboard box, just like | rubbish. They were so weak and | malnourished, it was touch and go | whether they would survive. | Thanks to the skill and care of our vets and nurses, Sky soon | regained her strength and made a full recovery. Now she’s happy | and loved in a new home, and we couldn't be happier for her! | The Animals Charity | Sadly, many more homeless pets like Sky need our | support. Just 20p a day could help end their suffering | and even save lives. | At Wood Green, we have the expertise and resources to care for 650 poorly | pets at any one time. But that’s only possible because of regular donations | from kind people like you. By donating just 20p a day, you really could transform | a homeless pets life. | The difference you can make | With your support, we can be there for more pets in need. | Your donations will help pay for everything from emergency | treatments to life-saving vaccinations. Giving 20p a day — | that’s just £6 a month - can make a huge difference. | ¢ Please detach the form and send it with your donation. No stamp required | ¢ Call our donation hotline on 0300 303 9876 | e Make your donation online at www.woodgreen.org.uk/support Ags et¢ | Our animal care teams worked | through the night providing the | kittens with delicate care and | warmth. Sadly, one of them didn’t | pull through. But the other four | made a full recovery and found | a loving new home. By giving 20p | a day, you'll help other pets get | a second chance at life. | 20p a day | Title First Name | Address. | Surname | Postcode | We care for homeless animals 365 days of the year. Giving £6 or more each month by Direct Debit | can help us care for even more animals all year round. It’s easy, safe and flexible. Thank you | I'd like to make a regular monthly donation of | £6 £8 or £ (please choose your own amount) | Starting on the Ist / 8th / 15th / 21st (circle one} | INSTRUCTION TO YOUR BANK OR BUILDING SOCIETY TO PAY BY DIRECT DEBIT ess: | Nameis} of account holder(s) | Bank Name Service User Number 6 9 5 0 13 | Signatures) Sort Code | Account Number | Date / / | Banks and Building Societies may not accept Direct Debit | Instruction to your Bank or Building Society: instructions for some types of accounts | Please pay Wood Green Animal Shelters Direct Debits from the account detailed in this instruction subject to the safeguards assured | by the Direct Debit Guarantee. | understand that this instruction may remain with Wood Green Animal Shelters and, if so, details will | be passed electronically to my Bank/Building Society | Without the kindness of people who remember Wood Green in their Will we could not continue to do our work - | these special gifts fund more than half of everything we do. To request your free Will guide, please tick here FOLD | £10 £18 £25 Other | Please make cheques/postal orders/CAF charity vouchers payable to Wood Green, The Animals Charity. | Or please charge my debit/credit/CAF card using the details below: | Your name as it appears on your card | Card no: Expiry date: | Signature Date | YES, | want to Gift Aid any donations | make in the future or have made in the past four years. | om a UK taxpayer and | understand that if | pay less Income Tax and/or Capital Gains Tax than the amount of Gift Aid on all my donations in any | tax year it is my responsibility to pay the difference gasses : | F fad d u“ i | Please notify Wood Green if you want to cance! this declaration, change your name or home address or no longer pay | You may contact me by email: | sufficient tox on your income/capital gains tax | @) REGULATOR | You may contact me by telephone: | We will send you mailings occasionally when we feel they will be of interest or you may be able to help. You can | change the way we contact you at any time by speaking to our friendly supporter relations team on 0300 303 9876, | emailing them at supporter relations@woodgreen.org uk, visiting woodgreen.yourpreferencecentre.com, or writing | to ""Freepost WOOD GREEN”. For further information, and to find out how Wood Green looks after your personal | information, see our privacy notice at woodareen org.uk/privacy | No, | am NOT a UK taxpayer Date g / | We'd like to send you — on how your support is making a difference. We will also | send you information about our work, latest news, events, opportunities to get involved | and fundraising. Simply let us know how you'd like to hear from us",Newspaper,NA,NA
