037,"Your kindness | gives Mary hope. | Initially, Mary was unsure about the Covid-19 vaccine. She’s not too keen on injections. | But your help means British Red Cross volunteers can be there in vaccination centres | across the nation, helping to put people like Mary at ease as they take the step to | protect themselves and others against the virus. | By supporting the British Red Cross, you can help those who need it, | when they need it, in ways they need it most. | To give help or get help, please visit | redcross.org.uk | uae BritishRedCross #PowerOfKindness",Newspaper,NA,NA
