073,"SHARED of | OF INVESTING IN A FAIRER WORLD | MAKE YOU | MONEY | COUNT | In Uganda, over 20% of the population | lives in poverty. Covid-19 has had severe | implications for both healthcare and trade, | with restrictions on movement leaving millions of | Ugandans unable to meet their daily nutritional needs. | Shared Interest continues to provide a reliable | source of finance at a time when the future remains | uncertain for most. | Co-operatives use our finance to pay their farmers as | promised and the Fairtrade Premium they receive is also | proving vital in providing support to communities. | The loan from Shared Interest has allowed us to pay | the farmers on time. The farmers are very grateful to | Shared Interest for support during a difficult period. | Josinta Kabugho, BOCU General Manager | Join us and help farmers to earn a living and feed | her family. | Find out more at shared-interest.com | BOCU member, | Meresi Kabugho | Open a Share Account with £100 and your money will support Call us on 0191 233 9100 | fair trade farmers and handcraft producers across the globe. or email info@shared-interest.com",Newspaper,NA,NA
