127,"> = pera ae > | Sightsavers : Sightsavers | 4 7) we | Nalukena geteeW x j N | cae | | SJ@ADS]YBIS | nowwn | zacc- | a+ 3 3 0 | -Fvuv0vTS | UO ® et | anor a8 | 2 aun ® | oz < | on=t oo | Soo 4 | I< OW | Will you Sian . | help protect | alukena | children fro wy bs | | Just £5 from you) | could save her sight. | could save her sight. | www.sightsavers.org/closer | | www.sightsavers.org/ p's www.sightsavers.org/closer | Trachoma steals sight with every blink... | Trachoma is an infection that's both agonising, and blinding. | At first, it makes your eyes itchy and sore. But if left | untreated, it develops into the more severe trichiasis - | which steals your sight blink by painful blink... | Nalukena had suffered from trachoma since birth - and | at just two years old, it was clear she was in real pain. | Her devastated parents did all they could to help their | little girl, but they didn't understand what was wrong. | They just knew it was getting worse. | Without help, | sight altogether. | You can save children from a life of pain | That’s why your support today is so vital. Together, we | can reach a whole class of children like Nalukena with | sight-saving treatment - and one day eliminate this cruel | infection for good. | From painful trachoma... | £5 could protect a class of children | Thankfully, we could help Nalukena with an antibiotic called | Zithromax* - which costs just 15p per treatment, and has the | power to stop trachoma in its tracks. | Now, Nalukena no longer has to live in pain, and can look forward | to a happy future. But there are still millions of children across | Africa who are moving closer to blindness each day. It's vital | we can treat them, before they lose their sight forever. | Your gift will save children’s sight | Just £5 from you is all it takes to provide Zithromax” for | a class of 33 children - saving them from blindness, and | moving us closer to our goal of eliminating trachoma by 2025. | To make a donation, simply compl