136,"> = pera ae > | Sightsavers : Sightsavers | 4 7) we | Nalukena geteeW x j N | cae | | SJ@ADS]YBIS | nowwn | zacc- | a+ 3 3 0 | -Fvuv0vTS | UO ® et | anor a8 | 2 aun ® | oz < | on=t oo | Soo 4 | I< OW | Will you Sian . | help protect | alukena | children fro wy bs | | Just £5 from you) | could save her sight. | could save her sight. | www.sightsavers.org/closer | | www.sightsavers.org/ p's www.sightsavers.org/closer | Trachoma steals sight with every blink... | Trachoma is an infection that's both agonising, and blinding. | At first, it makes your eyes itchy and sore. But if left | untreated, it develops into the more severe trichiasis - | which steals your sight blink by painful blink... | Nalukena had suffered from trachoma since birth - and | at just two years old, it was clear she was in real pain. | Her devastated parents did all they could to help their | little girl, but they didn't understand what was wrong. | They just knew it was getting worse. | Without help, | sight altogether. | You can save children from a life of pain | That’s why your support today is so vital. Together, we | can reach a whole class of children like Nalukena with | sight-saving treatment - and one day eliminate this cruel | infection for good. | From painful trachoma... | £5 could protect a class of children | Thankfully, we could help Nalukena with an antibiotic called | Zithromax* - which costs just 15p per treatment, and has the | power to stop trachoma in its tracks. | Now, Nalukena no longer has to live in pain, and can look forward | to a happy future. But there are still millions of children across | Africa who are moving closer to blindness each day. It's vital | we can treat them, before they lose their sight forever. | Your gift will save children’s sight | Just £5 from you is all it takes to provide Zithromax” for | a class of 33 children - saving them from blindness, and | moving us closer to our goal of eliminating trachoma by 2025. | To make a donation, simply complete the form | opposite and return it in the attached envelope, | give online, or call O800 298 2200 today. | little Nalukena was at risk of losing her | ...to blinding trichiasis | Trachoma starts with a | bite from an infected fly. @ | Will you send £5 today and save a class of children from blinding trachoma? | The eyes start to itch and weep, @ <p The eyelids then turn inwards, causing 4 <p> This condition is trichiasis, | and become very sore in sunlight. the eyelashes to scrape the eye. which eventually steals sight. | 4& DETACH HERE & | & DETACH HERE & | Yes, | want to give £5 to stop trachoma and save the sight of children like Nalukena | Title First name Surname | Full home address | Postcode | Phone number | Email | Are you happy to receive updates and find out how you can help by email or telephone? | If so, please fill in your details above. | We want you to be really proud of the work you're helping make ; | happen and will be in touch from time to time with updates about ThroughGiftAid,any dit | how your support is changing lives. To do this, we'll use the details donation you give will gifte | you've provided but promise never to sell or share your data. be worth 25% more. | If you'd rather not hear from us, please let us know by emailing tam a UK taxpayer and | would like | info@sightsavers.org or calling 01444 446600. Sightsavers to reclaim the tax paid on all my | past, present and future. | understand | [ 7 P : | | would like to make a donation of el [TT J-TT) that if | pay less Income Tax and/or Capital Gains | Tax in the current tax year than the amount | Please make cheque/postal order payable to Sightsavers tase poner of Gift Aid claimed on my donations, it is my | Or debit my: O MasterCard OVisa 0 CAF SEND CASH responsibility to pay any difference. | SC LILI ET LICE Lt (CJ I'd like Sightsavers to claim | Gift Aid on my donations. | eC LIC) be CLC | [Name on card | s! | [Signature | Date | Your donation will be used to support our work whereve