190,"MAKE A WILL. | What will happen to our world in the future? One thing is certain, Greenpeace will need to | be there. You can count on us to defend the natural world and do the right thing for our | living planet. We will protect our oceans, forests and climate, for people and all the earth’s | natural wonders. | Greenpeace is vital to saving our planet and a gift in your Will makes sure we're there. 1 in 6 | of our campaigns only happen because of donations left to us in people's Wills. | So, stand up for what you believe in. | Make a Will. Save the world. Thank you. | Search greenpeace.org.uk/save | Greenpeace favircamental Trust, registered Charity number 28493.4: Greenpeace. reqistered compeny number OPS P4381 Canacbury Vilas Lotdon NT 2PN",Newspaper,NA,NA
