192,"The Animals Charity | Freepost Plus RTKS-ZCXS-HSBT | Wood Green The Animals Charity | 126 Fairlie Road | Slough | SL1 4PY | URGENT APPEAL: | At Wood Green, The Animals Charity, | we care for up to 650 animals at | a time. We want to help every | unwanted and abandoned | animal who needs us. | Your urgent support is vital to help | save animals in desperate need. | Please donate 20p a day now. | Can you spare 20p a day for Can you spare 20p a cay for | an abandoned animal? an abandoned animal? | Please help with a gift of 20p a day. | to know she went on to make a full recovery. Since then, | she’s been rehomed to a loving family who have taken her | WOOD | GREEN into their hearts, and home. My details | Title: First Name: Sumame | Every day, animals like Pancake and Dennis come to us Address | The Animals Charity suffering from terrible neglect and injuries. A small, regular Postcode: | gift from you would make sure we are always ready to | provide the shelter, treatment and food they desperately | need - a second chance at life. | | want to make a difference every day | We care for homeless animals 365 days of the year. Giving £6 or more each month by Direct Debit | can help us care for even more animals all year round. It’s easy, safe and flexible. Thank you | I'd like to make a regular monthly donation of | 0 £6 C £8 or£é —t (please choose your own amount) | Starting on the Ist / 8th / 15th / 21st {circle one} | INSTRUCTION TO YOUR BANK OR BUILDING SOCIETY TO PAY BY DIRECT DEBIT ant | Namets} of account holderts) Service User Number 69/5, 0/1/3° | Too many neglected animals | are coming through our doors... | will you help with 20p a day? | Dear Friend, | Pancake’s amazing recovery was only possible because | of generous donations from people like you. | Please give 20p a day now to give an abandoned | animal the second chance at life they deserve. | Bank Name | Not even a year old, Pancake arrived at Wood Green Yours sincerely, | | | in a very poorly state.