203,"What will happen to our world in the future? One thing is certain, Greenpeace will | need to be there. You can count on us to defend the natural world and do the right | thing for our living planet. We will protect our oceans, forests and climate, for | people and all the earth’s natural wonders. | Greenpeace is vital to saving our planet and a gift in your Will makes sure we're | there. 1 in 6 of our campaigns only Nap because of donations left to us in | people's Wills. | So, stand up for what you believe in. | Make a Will. Save the world. Thank you. | Search greenpeace.org.uk/save",Newspaper,NA,NA
