reen, The Animals Charity. | | Or please charge my debit/credit/CAF card using the details below | Your name as it appears on your card | conte CLE LICLELICLLUICLL | Expiry date / | Signature: Date: | | |} / / | Please allow Wood Green to boost your donation by 25p for every £1 you donate. “a | In order to Gift Aid your donations you must tick the box below. x | fs 7 [_] Yes, | want to Gift Aid any donations | make in the future or have made in the past four years. | am a UK E | Dennis was found running around split in — places. He was in every sense a more sacle ie taxpayer and understand that if | pay less income Tax and/or Capital Gains Tax than the amount of Gift Aid on"" | sore and sorry sight. was rehomed — where all my donations in any tax year it is my responsibility to pay the difference. fe 2 it oa | near a road looking very poorly, . ns he’s thriving. Cnotomnotatkiopoe. cnet T]sCl)vClion) 3 gifewd | w ith bar ely any fur on parts of his Our Vet who examined Dennis described him as Please notify Wood Green if you want fo cancel this declaration, change your name or home address or uw | body. He was just one r old and very sweet. And that sunny disposition never went We don’t know for sure no longer pay sufficient tax on your income/capital gains tax. Se | p yea away — not through all the rounds of treatment to what happened to Dennis Keeping in touch . | H j j i j i We'd like to send yo dates on how your si rt is making a difference. We will also send you information | all alone. calm his skin, clear up his various infections and before he came to us. But cecil Gur vice, Kell naves, demasibe, ‘Geostunitas fo get involwed ond hendralsing Simply let os know how | ; get rid of the mites and other parasites that must we do know that if he hadn’t been you'd like to hear from us | It was winter, so he must have been freezing. have been causing him such discomfort. found and brought to Wood Green, he would almost You may contact me by email: RgeAcns | He was suff