you. | 207544 and $CO38110 | 4@ DETACH HERE | 4& DETACH HERE & | MOISTEN HERE AND SEAL | SIN' | Registered with | FUNDRAIS | REGULATOR | iS) Sightsavers | Every penny counts | and for every pound we receive"" | 91% goes on vital charity work | and our funding | Thank you for your support | $s 207544 and SCO3B110 | Registered charity number",Newspaper,NA,NA
274,"ofe Guide | Sponsor | - Dogs | a Puppy | Will you help | Derek | change | someone's life? | 1931 | 2021 | Guide Dogs | 90 Years | Find out more about our pups | and sponsor them online by visiting | guidedogs.org.uk/Derek | Make sure you select ‘Summer Leaflet’ | from the drop down list when you | order online to get your cuddly toy! | Or call us on freephone: | 0800 953 0333 | Guide Dogs is a working name of The Guide Dogs for the Blind Association. Registered Office: Hillfields, Burghfield Common, Reading, Berkshire RG7 3YG. | A company limited by guarantee registered in England and Wales (291646) and a charity registered in England and Wales (209617) and Scotland (SCO038979). | GDO0389 04/21. Tel: 0800 953 0333 Email: sapenquiries@guidedogs.org.uk Website: guidedogs.org.uk/Derek | Sponsor a guide dog | puppy today! You'll | receive regular | updates as your | puppy grows anda | cuddly toy from us | as a thank you. | You can also give the gift of — | a sponsorship to brighten — | up a loved one’s day. | Sign up today | to get a soft toy | as part of your | welcome pack! | Soft toy design may vary | ofe Guide | ” Dogs | Sponsor | a Puppy | Freepost RSBC-ARYS-YATB | Sponsor. Derek | Guide Dogs | Bumpers Way | Bumpers Farm | CHIPPENHAM | SN14 6NG | One day, Derek will transform | someone's life, but we need | your help to get him there. | Sponsoring a guide dog puppy like Derek is an | unforgettable experience that follows their journey | from six weeks old to the moment they are partnered | with someone living with sight loss. As Derek's sponsor, | you will be at the heart of his journey as he grows up to | become a life-changing guide dog. You can also sponsor | Derek as a gift, to let a loved one know you are thinking | of them. | I felt all my happiness and bubbliness | ‘ go away. I couldn't go out by myself. | In our 90 years as a charity, But as soon as Toffee came trotting up | we have created over 35,000 my road, I knew he was my dog. The | moment we met it was love! On the day | my friends graduated as nurses - | the day I would have graduated too | - I qualified as a guide dog owner | and started my new life with Toffee. | He inspired me to live again. | guide dog partnerships. | Guide Dogs works to empower people living with sight | loss and help to ensure they don't lose their freedom. | By sponsoring Derek your generosity will help transform | the lives of people living with sight loss, like Stacey. | Stacey lost her central vision when she was just 21. - Stacey | Did you know? Derek is named after Derek Freeman, founder of the Guide Dogs breeding programme. | There are hundreds of people From just £1 a week, | in the UK currently waiting for your sponsorship will include: | a guide dog. You can be part of © A cuddly guide dog puppy toy | their journey to independence. A fridge magnet | You can help our newest recruits, Derek, Judy, and | Niko, become fully trained guide dogs by sponsoring | them for yourself or a loved one from just £1 a week. | With your help, we can bring hope to the lives of even | more people in the UK living with sight loss. | Derek Judy Niko | Ts Win Designs may vary slightly. Electronic devices are | for illustrative purposes only, devices not included. | A photo album with regular photos | A sponsorship certificate | Access to your puppy's exclusive Facebook group | Regular ‘Pupdates’ for two years with news of | your puppy's progress | An exclusive calendar at the end of each year | The chance to forever change the life of a | person who is blind or partially sighted | Order today to get a soft toy as part of your welcome pack! | Please ensure your form is returned to us before 3 September 2021, or sign up | online/via phone by 5 September 2021. Derek, Judy, and Niko will no longer be available for sponsorship after this date. | auay ua]sioy | 2uay Ua}SIOW 2 4YOD}Eg | We will use your personal information, provided below, to process your sponsorship. | YES, I would like to sponsor | 