296,"Questions about smear tests? | We're here for you. | Coronavirus has changed a lot of things. | If you've been invited for cervical screening (a | smear test), you may have questions or | concerns about how your appointment will | work now. | Whether it's questions about going for a test, | or you want to talk about your results, we | offer free, confidential information and | Support. | No question is too big or too small.",Newspaper,NA,NA
