304,"Ethiopia-Tigray Emergency Appeal | GIVE SHELTER | £159 could provide a shelter kit — giving safety to families | fleeing the dreadful conflict. | Violence in Ethiopia’s Tigray region has seen more than two million people forced to flee their homes since the conflict started in | November 2020. Over 63,000 have fled into neighbouring Sudan, while those displaced inside Ethiopia include around 100,000 | refugees from Eritrea. | The region remains.a tinderbox. There have been reports WOODEN GABLE FRAME SHELTER | of hundreds of people killed, of atrocities, including forced | military recruitment of men and boys, and of widespread | sexual violence against women. | Displaced families urgently need shelter. People have been | sleeping in the open air, with no access to water or food. | UNHCR teams on the ground are doing all they can to protect | people, but with funds running desperately low, they urgently | need your support. | £159 could pay for a shelter kit. As the diagram shows, each | kit contains bamboo poles, a bamboo floor mat, roof beams, | and other local building materials with which a family shelter | can be built. With the rainy season fast approaching, the shelter | you help provide could be lifesaving. And it will do more than Detachnkahd Coaeeana Ook boein tial, beamay! baniboo | protect families from the elements; it will allow people to socially poles and sticks, rope, a bamboo mat for flooring | distance to protect themselves from COVID-19, and give women and ‘straw mesh to Tine the walls. | and girls a safe haven. | Example shelter kit from Sudan. Content and structure vary depending on — | Without shelter, they are intensely vulnerable. UNHCR’s Country location and materials available. | Representative, Ann Encontre, said: “/ am deeply concerned by | the widespread allegations of sexual violence against women and girls. The level of cruelty being reported defies belief.” | RIGHT NOW, SHELTER WILL SAVE PEOPLE’S LIVES. | Families have been forced to flee the terrifying violence and sought safety in other parts of Ethiopia’s Tigray region or in Sudan. | And every day a family spends without shelter, is a day when they are more at risk of contracting COVID-19, and a day when | women and girls remain more vulnerable to sexual violence. Please give £159, or whatever you can afford, today — there is not a | - moment to lose. | £159 COULD PROVIDE A SHELTER KIT | Give now at UNrefugees.org.uk/tigraycrisis | Call 0so0o 029 3883. or fill in and return the form below | e The kit you can help provide builds a shelter like | this, using locally available materials. | | would like to give: [_] ¢79 [_] e159 |_| 318 [| others Please return this form along with your cheque to: | L]1 enclose a cheque made payable to UK for UNHCR OR. Freepost UK FOR UNHCR Wyouldon't needa stamp) | LJ 1 would like to make a donation by debit/credit card Increase your donation by 25p for every £1 you donate iftaid it | Card no. Expiry date (1! would like UK for UNHCR to claim Gift Aid on this donation (currently 25p a | for each £1 donated), as well as any donations | make in the future and have made in the past four | | | | | | | ‘| | ] | | | | | | | | | | / | | yéars to UK for UNHCR, until | notify you otherwise. | confirm | am a UK taxpayer and | understand | that if | pay less Income Tax and/or Capital Gains Tax than the amount of Gift Aid claimed on all my | Signature Date donations in that tax year it is my responsibility to pay any difference. | understand that council tax | / / and VAT do not qualify. | ‘ If your circumstances change or you have any questions, please contact our Sundorter Care Team | L] Tick here, if you don’t want to receive an acknowledgement by post on 0800 029 3883 or email supportercare@unrefugees.org.uk | Title First name Last name _ Respecting your personal data: We will use your details to process your | Address donation and to keep you up to date with our work, fundraising activities and | other events. You c