356,"AFGHANISTAN APPEAL | Show them you care. | We must help Afghan refugees. | The Taliban takeover in Afghanistan has put millions of | innocent people at risk. Right now, people are fleeing in | desperation as they face human rights abuses and torture. It is | another stark reminder that nobody chooses to be a refugee. | Every week, Freedom from Torture sees people whose lives have been destroyed | by the Taliban, forcing them to flee the country. Ali* was just 14 when armed | men came to his village in Afghanistan, and SeuRtely. beat and tortured him all | because of his ethnicity - Hazara. | Today, as traumatised families from Afghanistan begin new lives in the UK, | we are gearing up to help more people like Ali. We must provide therapy and | financial support to every Afghan torture survivor who needs it. | Our communities can choose to do nothing. Or we can stand with people like | Ali - showing them they are welcome here in the UK. That they are not alone. | And that we will never stand for torture. Please will you help with an urgent *The name has been changed and a model has been used in the photograph to protect the identity | donation today? Thank you. of the torture survivor and their family. The story is true, as told by a survivor of torture. | Boost your donation by f avers | 25p of Gift Aid for every iftaid “wo | £1 you donate. | [| £55 could fund therapy and support for a survivor OR p Gift Aid is reclaimed by the charity from the tax you pay for | the current tax year. Your address is needed to identify you | as a current UK taxpayer. | my own choice of £ | Clyes, | want to Gift Aid this donation and any donations | | make in the future or have made in the past four years to | Chi enclose a cheque/postal order made payable to Freedom from Torture OR Freedom from Torture. | am a UK tax payer and understand | that if | pay less Income Tax and/or Capital Gains Tax than | L] Please charge my Visa / Mastercard / Maestro / Amex / CAF card: the amount of Gift Aid claimed on all my donations in that | tax year it is my responsibility to pa diff : | Card number | | | | | | | || | | | || | | | | | | oe 4 itis my responsibility to pay any difference | Print name: | Expiry date | hl | Issue i ait shed ou (Maestro only) ‘ pints | Date: / / | Signature(s) Today’s date E | | I/| | Sey Peas a UK taxpayer, and therefore cannot take | Title: Forename: Surname: Gift Aid is only valid if you fill in the details above. | Address: | Please fill in this form, place in an envelope | Pibstcoda: and return to: Freedom from Torture, | Many of our supporters like to hear about success stories, appeals, campaigns and events via email or phone. If you do too please enter your 111 Isledon Road, London, N7 7JW | contact details: : | Telephone: Email: Registered with | : FUNDRAISING | We may also continue to contact you by post for the above reasons for as long as you choose to support Freedom from Torture. If you do not wish REGULATOR | us to do so please tick this box [ ]. We will never sell or swap your data with any third party for their marketing purposes and you can read our 21PRO8A | rivacy policy here www.freedomfromtorture.org/privacy You can change the way we contact you at any time by calling us on 020 7697 7788 or | ee site eacladntitinitexture, org iP “ . 4 J y 6 Registered charity: England 1000340, Scotland SC039632.",Newspaper,NA,NA
