pia to | Afghanistan. | If you would like to stop receiving information by post, or you would like to change the way you hear from us, | please call our Supporter Care team on 020 7523 2493 or email info@christian-aid.org including your full name | and address. We promise never to share your details with any other organisation for marketing purposes. For | more information, please visit caid.org.uk/privacy | PO Box 100, London SE1 7RT ® Teleph 020 7620 4444 ia ane atl FUNDRAISING | ox 100, London * Telephone: 2 | Email: info@christian-aid.org ® caid.org.uk actalliance REGULATOR | Christian Aid is a key member of ACT Alliance. Eng and Wales charity no. 1105851 Scot charity no. SC039150 Company no. 5171525. The Christian Aid name and logo are trademarks of | Christian Aid. Printed exclusively on material sourced from responsibly managed forests © Christian Aid 2022 J177825 | Save a trip to | the postbox | Scan the code with | your phone to donate | online, or go to | caid.org.uk/now | Thank you | Scan me | Were there before, during and | after an emergency to save lives | and support people long term. | CHR44_5_1457963_070322\021476\42952\2o0f2\ | Your gift could help buy: | * £30 hygiene supplies for three people fleeing conflict. | e¢ £50 warm blankets for four families | ¢ £100 emergency food for two families for a month. | At the border crossing into Hungary, we met a woman named Yelena from the south of Ukraine. Yelena’s three children huddle | close to her, the youngest clutching her teddy bear. She told us: ‘We've been standing at this border checkpoint for more than | five hours, It's cold and my children are freezing. It is amazing to see that people are here to help. It gives us hope.’ | Please donate now to help families who are fleeing this crisis. A gift from you today could help bring blankets, hygiene | kits, and food to people who desperately want to keep their children safe. | It's estimated a staggering 7.5 million people will be displaced by this co